+// Patched copy of the vanilla 26.3 class (stage-2 terrain, docs/stage2/TERRAIN-PLAN.md S1/S2). Differences from vanilla:
+//  - each SectionDraw also carries the section-layer's TerrainMeshInfo from SectionCompiler.Results.terrainInfo, and
+//    whether its vertices were stored compact (S5, SectionCompiler.Results.compactVertices).
+//  - render-thread CPU work (S4 P1, TerrainToggles.fastDrawList): the draws are also kept in an array by layer ordinal,
+//    and the mesh mirrors its own uber-buffer allocations (heap buffer + offset per layer and kind, written by the
+//    AllocationListeners SectionRenderDispatcher installs), so TerrainDrawList needs no EnumMap/HashMap lookup and
+//    allocates nothing per section-layer.
